$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=bvfprodcxp  LOC_AFTER=?

* A finite product of real powers is the power of the product: prod_ k e. A ( ( F ` k ) ^c S ) = ( prod_ k e. A ( F ` k ) ) ^c S (through exp and log; Mathlib finsetProd_rpow).

